message: "If you use this software, please cite the accompanying paper."
title: "TSFM-MRE: Minimal Reproducible Experiment for Time-Series Foundation Models in Finance"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible, risk-aware evaluation of probabilistic forecasts for financial time
  series: proper scoring rules, VaR and expected-shortfall backtests, and Reality Check
  and SPA tests, applied to U.S. Treasury yields from the Federal Reserve H.15 release.
type: software
